Ideas only (no code copied)
---------------------------

- overlook (MIT): lumbridge-mail-render's rules for content hidden from the reader, the shape of the
  sanitiser allowlist, quote-container markers (Gmail, Apple Mail, Thunderbird, Yahoo, Outlook); the
  offline queue with send reconciliation.
- aviary (Apache-2.0): preparing HTML for a native/Blitz reader and cid: resolution (render); the durable
  outbox shape (state, attempts, next attempt time, interrupted rows on restart) in
  lumbridge-mail-store's action queue.
- Zero (MIT, ai-mail/Zero): prompt ideas in lumbridge-mail-ai.
- himalaya (Apache-2.0): CLI and account-config shape for lbmail.
- gogcli (MIT): the JSON gog prints, read from its source to write lumbridge-mail-gog's parsers and the
  made-up fixtures.

GPL / AGPL / unlicensed references (katna, mailapp, meli, Mailspring, inbox-zero, minimail, maildesk,
bgmail, gpui-email) were read for ideas at most; no code from them is in this repository.
